WEBVTT

00:05:27.754 --> 00:05:30.572
or hear the word, or eat
the food their hands may grow,

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:31.833
but yet again I may;

00:05:31.857 --> 00:05:33.008
And later I may say,

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:37.087
I knew him once, and he was weak,
or strong, or bold or proud or gay.

00:05:37.111 --> 00:05:39.456
I knew him once, but then he was a boy.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.750
They ask me why I teach and I reply,

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:44.424
'Where could I find such
splendid company?'"

00:05:44.448 --> 00:05:46.376
And I believe the teaching profession --

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.462
it's true, you have so many youngsters,

00:05:48.486 --> 00:05:50.875
and I've got to think
of my youngsters at UCLA --

00:05:50.899 --> 00:05:55.711
30-some attorneys,
11 dentists and doctors,

00:05:55.735 --> 00:05:58.976
many, many teachers and other professions.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.798
And that gives you
a great deal of pleasure,